# OPT-IN Android compatibility runtime package set for the Pixel 9a dev
# route (owner request 2026-10-09; ADR-005/ADR-007). tools/pixel-9a/rootfs.sh
# appends these to pmbootstrap's extra_packages only when
# FERRIX_PIXEL9A_ANDROID=1. One Alpine package name per line.
#
# Deliberately absent: nftables and waydroid-nftrules. The pinned GKI has no
# CONFIG_NF_TABLES, so waydroid-net.sh must take its iptables(-legacy) path;
# rootfs.sh refuses a built rootfs that contains either package.
# Also absent: pipewire-pulse. pmOS's console UI pulls
# postmarketos-base-ui-audio-backend-pulseaudio, which apk declares as
# conflicting with it; Waydroid 1.6 starts without a pulse socket (no
# Android audio yet).
waydroid
waydroid-openrc
lxc
dnsmasq
iptables
